<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 565.44, off 1.21.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 287 to 240.</p>
<p>Average price per share fell $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 17,862,190 versus 21,162,380 Wednesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
